      "description": "Mike's Song and Tweezer both contained BEK teases, with the ones in Tweezer taking place well before the segue into BEK. Fans of stage banter will want to seek out the second set for Trey’s humorous response to the crowd’s Destiny Unbound chant before Halley’s. The \"Marco Esquandolas\" lyric in Antelope was changed to \"Michael Esquandolas.\" This show was released as part of the <em>Hampton/Winston-Salem '97</em> box set.",
