      "taper_notes": "Phish\r\nNovember 21, 1997\r\nHampton Coliseum\r\nHampton, VA\r\n\r\nsource:\r\n(FOB) Schoeps mk4 > kc5 > cmc5 > Sonosax SX-M2 > Sony D3 (@ 48 kHz)\r\n\r\ntransfer:\r\nTascam DA-20MKII > Tascam HD-P2 > CF card > usb 2.0 > pc > WaveLab 5.01b (fades) > r8brain v1.9 (resample to 44.1 kHz) > CD Wave v1.96.1 > FLAC v1.2.1 (Level 8)\r\n\r\nFLAC tags added with metaflac v1.2.1\r\n\r\nrecorded by Dan, Boris, and Brian\r\ntransferred by Jason Sobel (jasonsobel@gmail.com)\r\nseeded January 27, 2008\r\n\r\nnotes:\r\nThe original 48 kHz .wav files from the DAT transfer have been archived, and are available upon request.\r\nBig thanks to Eliot Byron for letting me borrow his DATs!\r\n\r\nDisc 1 - [74:41]\r\nSet I\r\n01 - [16:33] - Mike's Song ->\r\n02 - [04:34] - I Am Hydrogen >\r\n03 - [14:56] - Weekapaug Groove\r\n04 - [18:02] - Harry Hood\r\n05 - [03:08] - Train Song\r\n06 - [07:03] - Billy Breathes\r\n07 - [04:48] - Frankenstein\r\n08 - [05:36] - Izabella\r\n\r\nDisc 2 - [75:02]\r\nSet II\r\n01 - [01:51] - intro\r\n02 - [24:17] - Halley's Comet \r\n03 - [11:40] - Tweezer ->\r\n04 - [06:58] - Black-Eyed Katy \r\n05 - [07:53] - Piper\r\n06 - [12:34] - Run Like An Antelope\r\n07 - [02:13] - encore break\r\n08 - [03:50] - Bouncing Around the Room\r\n09 - [03:46] - Tweezer Reprise",
